00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.950
- Peanut butter and Oreos.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:50.916
- Just sounds good.

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:51.749
(group laughs)

00:00:51.749 --> 00:00:53.520
- It sounds crazy, but corn starch.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.900
