00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:15.210
- Well, I don't go to the gym.

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.540
I feel like there's things
that you can do to keep active

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.190
so you're not so stagnant.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:22.170
And right now, since I'm so far along,

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:24.733
it's just like how many
times an hour can I get up.

00:01:24.733 --> 00:01:25.566
- Right.

00:01:25.566 --> 00:01:27.360
- And walk to the other
side of my apartment.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:30.893
- I usually walk, but I do work out.

00:01:30.893 --> 00:01:34.290
I used to lift heavy, but now
I have to use lighter weights.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.369
