00:01:36.369 --> 00:01:37.202
(overplay of children laughing)

00:01:37.202 --> 00:01:39.090
And sitting down when I can. (laughs)

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:39.923
- That's a good answer.

00:01:39.923 --> 00:01:41.220
- I like to do yoga.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.650
I kind of just keep it minimal.

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:46.380
I used to do yoga before I was pregnant.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.030
It's a little harder now,

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:51.450
but I try to keep as active as possible.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.970
- So I try to walk about
20 minutes every day

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:56.580
and then also just doing a
lot of squats is really good.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.940
- It's also good for your booty.

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:58.956
(upbeat rock music)

00:01:58.956 --> 00:01:59.789
I've heard.
- Yeah.

00:01:59.789 --> 00:02:00.918
(group laughs)

00:02:00.918 --> 00:02:03.930
- Like she said, I just
chase after my two year old.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.536
- I think we're ready
to make an elimination.

00:02:05.536 --> 00:02:06.990
