up to it a little bit.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.190
- How often do you guys pee?

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:24.060
- All the time.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.980
And as the pregnancy gets further along,

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.870
just more consistently throughout the day.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.360
It's really annoying actually, so.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:33.450
- I would say I wake up
like, four or five times

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.580
in the middle of the night.
- It's the same amount.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.149
About four or five times during the night.

00:02:38.149 --> 00:02:42.630
I'm still breastfeeding too,
so I'm waking up to feed.

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:44.640
- It's every hour for me.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:47.011
I actually have to pee really soon.

00:02:47.011 --> 00:02:47.844
(toilet flushing)

00:02:47.844 --> 00:02:50.700
- I go probably every
two hours during the day

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:53.730
and then at night, I get up
around five to six times.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.710
- My bladder is always getting danced on.

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.390
- Yeah.
- Like, I would use a restroom

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.070
and then like sometimes
would have to go back.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.090
Like, I thought I emptied it.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.290
Yeah, no. (laughs)

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.090
