out for who was trying

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:05.700
to like, explain too much.

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.350
- Do you have any baby names planned?

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:08.520
- And is it a boy or a girl?

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.420
- If you know already, yeah.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.410
- I don't wanna know.
- Okay.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.700
- I want it to be a surprise,

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.700
but if it's a girl, she'll be Deana.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:18.420
A couple weeks after I found
out that I was pregnant,

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:20.940
my grandmother named Deana passed away

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:23.760
and we were very close,
so that's the only one

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.740
and I feel that she's a girl.

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.150
That would be really special to me.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.470
- I don't know yet.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:31.263
I'm undecided because yeah.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.140
Probably Trent Jr.

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:37.800
- So my two other kids, they have Z names,

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:41.310
so the last one I want to be Zion.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.280
- It's my first girl so
I wanna name her Emery.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.500
I want my kids names to be all colors.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:49.950
- She's a girl and I wanted a name

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:53.400
that like, represented peace
so her name's gonna be Shiloh.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.100
