You asked that baby genie. I
don't even know what that is.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:31.883
- Really?

00:10:31.883 --> 00:10:33.990
- So I'm glad that you that you
didn't ask me that question.

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:36.450
- My mom just told me
to ask that. (laughs)

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:40.276
- Because team boys was able
to lock in the real deal first,

00:10:40.276 --> 00:10:43.626
they will actually win the prize today.

00:10:43.626 --> 00:10:45.300
(gentle music)

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.490
- The experience was really fun.

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:49.770
Like I shared, I only
have about two weeks left

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:52.380
so I think leading up to
this, I just kept thinking,

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:54.540
oh, my gosh, she needs to stay in my belly

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.610
until this shoot is over.

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:59.430
- She was just like, more energetic

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:00.420
than the rest of the moms.

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:02.820
I feel like what really helped us lock in

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:05.760
was her knowing about
the gestational diabetes.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.020
- That's actually what
we were looking for.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:09.180
- We had it between like,
number one and number five.

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.055
- Yeah.

00:11:10.055 --> 00:11:12.270
- But it was very clear that
she was a really good actress.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.100
- This is my first pregnancy.

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:15.450
I'm really, really excited.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:17.790
It's like, it's such a privilege

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.890
and an honor to be able to be a mom.

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:21.240
Like, do I have everything in me

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.650
to be able to protect this child

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.260
and to like, help her
grow into this world?

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:28.140
Me and my husband Paulo, we'll
do our best to create a space

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:31.020
where she feels loved and seen and heard.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.480
We're grateful for the
community that we have

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:36.030
and I hope that other pregnant women feel

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:37.320
that it's okay to be scared

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:40.143
and also feel okay to
depend on other people.

